# Media Server Resources

**Status:** Reference Guide
**Target Platform:** Bazzite + Podman/Docker
**Focus:** External resources and links for self-hosted media

---

## Overview

This is a **reference guide** for users interested in setting up media servers on Bazzite. Media server setup is a complex topic beyond KENL's gaming focus, so we point to established community resources.

**⚠️ Note:** Setting up a full media server (Radarr/Sonarr/Jellyfin/Plex) is a separate project. See r/selfhosted and r/jellyfin for detailed guides.

**KENL provides:**
- 📚 Links to quality setup guides
- 🐳 Container-based approach (Bazzite-compatible)
- 🔗 Community resources

---

## Popular Media Server Software

### Media Servers
- **Jellyfin** (Free, open-source) - https://jellyfin.org/
- **Plex** (Freemium) - https://www.plex.tv/
- **Emby** (Freemium) - https://emby.media/

### Download Automation (Optional)
- **Radarr** (Movies) - https://radarr.video/
- **Sonarr** (TV Shows) - https://sonarr.tv/
- **Prowlarr** (Indexer manager) - https://prowlarr.com/

### Container Deployment
- **Official Jellyfin on Podman** - https://jellyfin.org/docs/general/installation/container
- **LinuxServer.io Containers** - https://fleet.linuxserver.io/ (pre-built images)

