## Bazzite-Specific Considerations

**Immutable OS (rpm-ostree):**
- ✅ Use containers (Podman/Docker) - system stays clean
- ✅ Store data in `/mnt/` or `/home/` (persistent)
- ❌ Don't layer packages with rpm-ostree (breaks atomicity)
    F --> G[✅ Movie ready to watch]

    style A fill:#d0ebff,stroke:#228be6
    style G fill:#d3f9d8,stroke:#51cf66
```

**Time per media item:** 0 minutes (fully automated)

